add('context-two-groups','Left column opening paragraph','secondary_research_context','Independent groups at Indiana University, Bloomington, and the University of California, Berkeley use fluorescent semiconductor nanocrystals to detect biomolecules and study biological processes. No reproducible protocol is given.')
