add('material-berkeley-shells','Left column second paragraph','secondary_material_context','The Berkeley team uses ZnS or CdS shells. Preserve the alternatives; the page does not establish a simultaneous ZnS/CdS multilayer, alloy, or common shell thickness.')
add('context-bioactivity','Left column second paragraph','secondary_biological_context','Both groups are said to retain biomolecular activity after labeling and produce brightly colored tagged products. No assay concentrations, controls, quantitative activity or primary sample identifiers are supplied.')
