add('image-caption-green','Caption below bottom-left image','secondary_image_caption','The caption attributes green mouse-cell nuclei to 2 nm quantum dots coated with urea and acetate groups. Preserve these named surface groups without inventing their full ligand identities, surface coverage or functionalization chemistry.')
