add('schematic-protein-link','Central illustration, lower chain attached to Protein','illustrative_schematic','The lower drawn chain links the particle surface through S–CH2–C(=O)–NH to a sphere labeled Protein. The drawing communicates a conceptual conjugation linkage but supplies neither a coupling procedure nor measured coordination, ligand density or biomolecular conformation.')
